<title>MEXICO: Mexico Bondes rate basically unchanged at auction.</title>
<headline>Mexico Bondes rate basically unchanged at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rate on Mexican government 728-day Bondes fell 0.01 percentage points to 1.19 percent above the 28-day Cetes rate, dealers estimated.</p>
<p>The 728-day Bondes were assigned at 98.02221 pesos.</p>
<p>Demand for the Bondes was 2.87 billion pesos compared with the 900 million offered by Banco de Mexico.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
